                                </div>
                                <div id="collapse5" class="collapse">
                                    <div class="card-body text">
                                        <p>Costs vary widely depending on the level of professional services you use. A basic budget covering proofreading, a pre-made cover, and DIY formatting might come in under $500. A more comprehensive investment including developmental editing, custom cover design, professional formatting, and marketing could run between $2,000 and $5,000 or more.</p>
