                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div id="collapse7" class="collapse">
                                    <div class="card-body text">
                                        <p>From finished manuscript to published book, most authors should allow three to six months. This accounts for editing (which can take several weeks to months), cover design, formatting, ISBN acquisition, platform setup, and pre-launch marketing. Rushing the process almost always results in a lower quality product.</p>
