                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div id="collapse8" class="collapse">
                                    <div class="card-body text">
                                        <p>Yes. Professional editing is one of the most important investments you'll make. At minimum, have your manuscript professionally proofread. Ideally, invest in copy editing as well. For first-time authors, a developmental edit can be transformative for the quality of your book.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
