                                <div id="collapse10" class="collapse">
                                    <div class="card-body text">
                                        <p>The key Australian-specific considerations are purchasing your ISBNs through Thorpe-Bowker, using IngramSpark for distribution into Australian bookstores and libraries, meeting your Legal Deposit obligations with the National Library of Australia, and understanding your tax obligations through the ATO. This guide covers all of these in detail.</p>
